{
  "source": "Prompts/avoid-opener-3.mp4",
  "duration": 207.795375,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 8.58,
      "text": "The architecture that makes artificial intelligence so incredibly capable also has very specific, highly predictable ways of failing."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.3,
      "end": 11.72,
      "text": "And it doesn't fail like the machines we are used to."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.36,
      "end": 15.7,
      "text": "When your car engine gives out, you hear a loud clank and see smoke."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.42,
      "end": 18.8,
      "text": "When software crashes, you get a glaring error message."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.5,
      "end": 23.4,
      "text": "But when an AI system breaks down, the interface keeps humming along perfectly."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.4,
      "end": 33.46,
      "text": "It can invent a completely fabricated historical event, or an entirely fake legal citation, and type it out with absolute unwavering confidence."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.26,
      "end": 42.16,
      "text": "It might agree with a flawed premise you've provided, using a polite, accommodating tone that makes you feel smart while calmly feeding you bad logic."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.9,
      "end": 51.12,
      "text": "Or it can generate a photograph of an event that never happened, rendering the lighting and textures so flawlessly that your eyes register it as real."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.78,
      "end": 54.7,
      "text": "We are wired by evolution to look for obvious threats."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.38,
      "end": 57.52,
      "text": "A growl, a sharp drop, a glitch."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.2,
      "end": 60.36,
      "text": "But those red flags simply don't exist here."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.04,
      "end": 68.26,
      "text": "Because the outer casing never shatters, relying on your standard gut feeling to tell you if the system is working properly is a major vulnerability."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.24,
      "end": 71.24,
      "text": "Think about how this works in the physical world."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.82,
      "end": 77.16,
      "text": "If you go to the ocean, some of the most dangerous hazards are entirely invisible beneath a beautiful surface."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.9,
      "end": 79.76,
      "text": "A rip current actively disguises itself."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.76,
      "end": 82.6,
      "text": "It doesn't look like a churning vortex."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.52,
      "end": 89.34,
      "text": "It looks like a calm, flat channel, nestled quietly right between the crashing breaking waves."
    },
    {
      "start": 90.14,
      "end": 95.0,
      "text": "To an untrained eye, that patch of smooth water looks incredibly inviting."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.8,
      "end": 99.68,
      "text": "It seems like exactly the spot where you'd want to wait in and relax."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.42,
      "end": 109.36,
      "text": "But the moment you step waist deep into that seemingly tranquil gap, the water grips you, rapidly pulling you hundreds of yards away from the beach."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.36,
      "end": 113.58,
      "text": "At that point, survival isn't about being an Olympic athlete."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.56,
      "end": 119.04,
      "text": "You cannot out swim that volume of moving water through sheer physical strength."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.04,
      "end": 122.18,
      "text": "This is why lifeguards are so effective."
    },
    {
      "start": 122.96,
      "end": 124.8,
      "text": "Their real advantage isn't their freestyle stroke."
    },
    {
      "start": 125.7,
      "end": 128.72,
      "text": "It is their ability to continuously observe the environment."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.42,
      "end": 135.3,
      "text": "They know how to scan the shoreline and spot the distinct, subtle shape the rip current makes on the surface of the water."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.82,
      "end": 137.64,
      "text": "Long before anyone even lays down a towel."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.32,
      "end": 141.5,
      "text": "True safety isn't about fighting your way out of a disaster."
    },
    {
      "start": 142.4,
      "end": 146.12,
      "text": "It is about recognizing the structure of a trap before you ever step inside."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.04,
      "end": 150.6,
      "text": "Interacting with large language models carries the exact same dynamic."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.28,
      "end": 153.16,
      "text": "The AI has its own rip currents."
    },
    {
      "start": 153.82,
      "end": 157.24,
      "text": "To use these tools safely, you have to adopt a lifeguard's mindset."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.96,
      "end": 162.36,
      "text": "You need to learn how to spot the specific shapes of deceptive digital currents."
    },
    {
      "start": 163.06,
      "end": 166.24,
      "text": "This is what our avoid traps curriculum is all about."
    },
    {
      "start": 166.24,
      "end": 170.04,
      "text": "It's the training required to develop that observational reflex."
    },
    {
      "start": 170.78,
      "end": 173.76,
      "text": "Here are the three questions this section will help you answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 174.52,
      "end": 180.82,
      "text": "First, why can an AI sound so completely sure of itself and still be entirely wrong?"
    },
    {
      "start": 181.56,
      "end": 186.3,
      "text": "Next, under what specific conditions might you be trusting the AI too much?"
    },
    {
      "start": 187.02,
      "end": 194.74,
      "text": "Finally, if the system can create convincing fakes, what exact checkpoints do you need to clear before trusting what you see or hear?"
    },
    {
      "start": 194.74,
      "end": 197.46,
      "text": "Always remember the core paradox."
    },
    {
      "start": 198.34,
      "end": 201.3,
      "text": "When artificial intelligence fails, nothing looks broken."
    },
    {
      "start": 202.12,
      "end": 204.12,
      "text": "This section teaches you to read the water."
    }
  ],
